*==============================================================================
* PLFS Mincer Wage Equation, 4-Year Appended Panel, [STATE PENDING]
* Author: Abhishek Anand Sinha
* This do-file will be filled in once:
*   (1) State is finalized
*   (2) describe, full / codebook output confirms variable names
*   (3) Survey weight variable and PID consistency across rounds is verified
*==============================================================================

* --- 0. Setup -----------------------------------------------------------
clear all
set more off
* cd "path/to/data"

* --- 1. Load appended panel ----------------------------------------------
* use "data/plfs_[state]_panel_4yr.dta", clear

* --- 2. Variable checks (run once, before finalizing) ---------------------
* describe, full
* codebook PID year weight
* duplicates report PID year

* --- 3. Construct Mincer variables ----------------------------------------
* gen experience = age - year_edu - 6
* gen exp2 = experience^2
* gen ln_wage = ln(wage)

* --- 4. Pooled OLS ---------------------------------------------------------
* regress ln_wage year_edu experience exp2 i.year [pweight=weight]
* outreg2 using "outputs/tables/pooled_ols.xls", replace

* --- 5. Fixed Effects (within estimator) -----------------------------------
* xtset PID year
* xtreg ln_wage year_edu experience exp2 i.year [pweight=weight], fe
* outreg2 using "outputs/tables/fe_results.xls", replace

* --- 6. Subgroup regressions (stratified, not interacted) ------------------
* bysort social_group: regress ln_wage year_edu experience exp2
* bysort sex: regress ln_wage year_edu experience exp2
* bysort religion: regress ln_wage year_edu experience exp2

* --- 7. Diagnostics & visualization -----------------------------------------
* coefplot, drop(_cons) xline(0)
* graph export "outputs/graphs/coefplot_pooled_vs_fe.png", replace
